  "evidenceNotes": [
    "The default LOGOS list loads real image files from public/assets whose filenames are third-party brand marks (six of the ten grid logos: logo-volvo.png, logo-burgerking.png, logo-vodafone.png, logo-ba.png, logo-krispykreme.svg, logo-nothingbundt.png); the remaining four render the neutral placeholder. A generator should treat every slot as placeholder.neutral.",
    "The in-slide logo and grid logos use LogoPlaceholder, whose default label text is 'Logo' (alt 'Customer logo' applies only when an image file is loaded).",
    "The nested video is src/components/VideoSection.jsx passed as children; it lives inside the reviews <section> exactly as the original nests section_kiki-video, so it is modelled here rather than as a separate section instance."
  ],
